# Noelle Yelan Furina Xilonen. ~22s Rot. Noelle is built for damage. Crystallize shards are caught by Noelle or with dashes or movement. Noelle Def > Geo DMG Goblet. Furina's HP remains high through the rotation. AP option in config.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
noelle char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
noelle add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
